  "We Are Here to Pray & Walk With You": "Tuko Hapa Kuomba na Kutembea Nawe",
  "We believe believers are called to reign in life through Christ Jesus, destroying works of darkness, discipling communities, and shining as the light of the world.": "Tunaamini waumini wameitwa kutawala maishani kupitia Kristo Yesu, wakiharibu kazi za giza, wakifanya jamii kuwa wanafunzi, na wakiangaza kama nuru ya ulimwengu.",
  "We believe in one God, eternally existent in three co-equal persons: the Father, the Son, and the Holy Spirit.": "Tunaamini katika Mungu mmoja, aishiye milele katika nafsi tatu zilizo sawa: Baba, Mwana, na Roho Mtakatifu.",
  "We believe in the baptism of the Holy Spirit with evidence of speaking in tongues, the active manifestation of spiritual gifts, and His indwelling power for victorious Christian living.": "Tunaamini katika ubatizo wa Roho Mtakatifu ukiwa na ishara ya kunena kwa lugha, udhihirisho hai wa karama za kiroho, na nguvu Zake zikaazo ndani kwa ajili ya maisha ya Kikristo yenye ushindi.",
  "We believe in the grace of giving—honouring God through faithful tithes, generous offerings, and purposeful partnership to advance the Gospel and care for the vulnerable.": "Tunaamini katika neema ya utoaji—kumheshimu Mungu kupitia zaka za uaminifu, sadaka za ukarimu, na ushirika wenye kusudi ili kuendeleza Injili na kuwatunza wahitaji.",
  "We believe in the personal, imminent return of our Lord Jesus Christ, the resurrection of the just to eternal glory, and the judgment of the lost.": "Tunaamini katika kurudi binafsi kuliko karibu kwa Bwana wetu Yesu Kristo, ufufuo wa wenye haki kuingia katika utukufu wa milele, na hukumu ya waliopotea.",
  "We believe in the virgin birth, sinless life, substitutionary atoning death, bodily resurrection, ascension to the Father’s right hand, and visible return of our Lord Jesus Christ.": "Tunaamini katika kuzaliwa na bikira, maisha yasiyo na dhambi, kifo cha upatanisho badala yetu, kufufuka kwa mwili, kupaa kwenda kuume kwa Baba, na kurudi kunakoonekana kwa Bwana wetu Yesu Kristo.",
  "We believe that anyone who is in Christ is a new creation, made the righteousness of God in Him, permanently justified, sanctified, and perfected forever.": "Tunaamini kwamba mtu yeyote aliye ndani ya Kristo ni kiumbe kipya, amefanywa haki ya Mungu ndani Yake, amehesabiwa haki daima, ametakaswa, na amekamilishwa milele.",
  "We believe that deliverance from sickness is provided in the atonement of Jesus Christ and is the covenant privilege of every believer today.": "Tunaamini kwamba ukombozi kutoka kwa magonjwa umetolewa katika upatanisho wa Yesu Kristo na ni haki ya agano ya kila mwamini leo.",
  "We believe that salvation is received solely by grace through faith in the finished work of Jesus Christ, completely apart from human merit or law-keeping.": "Tunaamini kwamba wokovu hupokelewa kwa neema pekee kupitia imani katika kazi iliyokamilika ya Yesu Kristo, mbali kabisa na ustahili wa kibinadamu au kushika sheria.",
  "We believe the Church is the living body of Christ, comprised of all genuine believers, called to gather locally and virtually to worship, disciple, and advance God’s Kingdom.": "Tunaamini Kanisa ni mwili ulio hai wa Kristo, unaoundwa na waumini wote wa kweli, walioitwa kukusanyika mahali pamoja na mtandaoni kuabudu, kufanya wanafunzi, na kuendeleza Ufalme wa Mungu.",
  "We believe the Holy Bible is the inspired, infallible, and authoritative Word of God, given as the supreme and final standard of faith, life, and doctrine.": "Tunaamini Biblia Takatifu ni Neno la Mungu lililovuviwa, lisilo na makosa, na lenye mamlaka, lililotolewa kama kipimo kikuu na cha mwisho cha imani, maisha, na mafundisho.",
  "We observe water baptism by immersion as an outward declaration of our union with Christ, and the Lord’s Supper as a joyful celebration of His body and blood.": "Tunadumisha ubatizo wa maji kwa kuzamishwa kama tangazo la nje la muungano wetu na Kristo, na Meza ya Bwana kama sherehe ya furaha ya mwili na damu Yake.",
  "We want you to know that you are God’s beloved, and that He has great plans and good things in store for you! He wants you blessed wherever you are and in whatever you put your hands to.": "Tunapenda ujue kwamba wewe ni mpendwa wa Mungu, na kwamba Ana mipango mikubwa na mema tele yaliyowekwa kwa ajili yako! Anataka ubarikiwe popote ulipo na katika kila jambo unalolifanya kwa mikono yako.",
  "We will send you the direct stream link 30 minutes before {title} begins.": "Tutakutumia kiungo cha moja kwa moja cha matangazo dakika 30 kabla ya {title} kuanza.",
