  "Whether Ephesus Gatherings Worldwide is your primary church home or you belong to a local church while staying connected to this stream, you are warmly welcomed.": "Iwe Ephesus Gatherings Worldwide ni kanisa lako kuu la nyumbani au wewe ni mshiriki wa kanisa la mahali huku ukiendelea kuunganishwa na huduma hii, unakaribishwa kwa mikono miwili.",
  "Whether Ephesus Gatherings Worldwide will be your primary spiritual home as a Member (in-person at The Son Place or online worldwide) or a stream where you occasionally fellowship as an Affiliate, there is a place prepared for you.": "Iwe Ephesus Gatherings Worldwide itakuwa nyumbani kwako kuu kiroho kama Mshiriki (ana kwa ana katika The Son Place au mtandaoni ulimwenguni kote) au huduma ambapo unashirikiana mara kwa mara kama Mshirika wa Ushirika, kuna nafasi iliyoandaliwa kwa ajili yako.",
  "Whether you are sharing a confidential prayer request, seeking pastoral counsel, volunteering in a ministry department, or asking a question—our team reads every message personally.": "Iwe unashiriki ombi la siri la maombi, unatafuta ushauri wa kichungaji, unajitolea katika idara ya huduma, au unauliza swali—timu yetu husoma kila ujumbe binafsi.",
